{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":9},"La Bombe et Nous","Sommes-nous pris au piège de l’arme nucléaire ? Peut-on vivre sans elle ? Peut-on penser le monde autrement que par un équilibre de la terreur ? Est-elle, au contraire, un gage de paix et de stabilité ? Depuis la naissance même de l’engin ces questions alimentent les peurs les plus terribles et les discours les plus dangereux. Avec des intervenants de tous bords : militaires, scientifiques, historiens, militants, hommes politiques, ce film se propose de porter la réflexion sur l’actualité et l’avenir du nucléaire militaire.",[4,5,6,7,8],"high rank employment","state institutions","collective trauma","activism","professional politics",{"type":10,"id":11,"slug":12,"title":13,"release":15,"filmType":19,"directors":20,"genre":29,"media":31,"synopsis":34,"production":35,"characters":38,"roles":39,"awards":102,"tags":3},"Film","FR2017_164","fr2017-164-la-bombe-et-nous",{"native":1,"english":14},"",{"type":16,"date":17,"year":18},"Theatrical release","2017-11-01",2017,"Documentary",[21],{"id":22,"slug":23,"name":22,"birthYear":24,"deathYear":25,"gender":26,"nationality":27,"awards":28},"Xavier-Marie Bonnot","xavier-marie-bonnot",1962,0,"Male identifying","France",[],[30],"Documentary – Participatory mode",{"posterUrl":32,"trailerUrl":33},"https://fr.web.img3.acsta.net/c_310_420/pictures/17/09/18/11/34/1921739.jpg","https://www.dailymotion.com/video/x640ync",{"native":2,"english":14},[36],{"country":27,"share":37},"Majority coproducer",[],[40,47,54,60,66,73,80,86,93,97],{"person":41,"role":46},{"id":42,"slug":43,"name":42,"birthYear":44,"deathYear":25,"gender":26,"nationality":27,"awards":45},"Bernard Norlain","bernard-norlain",1939,[],"Documentary subject",{"person":48,"role":46},{"id":49,"slug":50,"name":49,"birthYear":51,"deathYear":52,"gender":26,"nationality":27,"awards":53},"Dominique Lalanne","dominique-lalanne",1943,2022,[],{"person":55,"role":46},{"id":